# packages.list
#
# Every apt package the guest installs, one per line. Comments start with '#'.
# build-package-repo.sh resolves the dependency closure of this list on a host
# that matches the target (Ubuntu 26.04 amd64) and stages it as an on-ISO apt
# repository. guest-install.sh installs exactly these names from that repo, with
# no network. Keep the list as the single source of truth for guest packages.

# Base utilities and the VMware guest agent (formerly the late-commands list)
open-vm-tools
less
tree
nano
dos2unix
iputils-ping
pv
unzip
pigz
figlet
locales

# Developer toolchain (formerly installed by setup-vm.sh)
git
openjdk-25-jdk-headless
python3
python3-build
python3-venv
apt-rdepends
podman
uidmap
passt

# Local-build toolchain. Lets the VM run full local builds of the code the sdlc
# build images cover (Python utilities under tsdev-utilities, bash build-scripts
# under tsdev-sdlc-tools), matching what those images install.
#   python3-pip  - the Python SBOM step builds a throwaway venv and runs
#                  `pip install`/`pip freeze` (common-generate-python-sbom.sh).
#   shellcheck   - bash static analysis for script-type (build-scripts) builds.
# Non-apt build tools (syft, shfmt, uv) are pinned binaries staged on the ISO by
# fetch-build-tools.sh + guest-install.sh, not installed from this list.
python3-pip
shellcheck

# Data disk encryption + SMB file sharing
#   cryptsetup-bin - the cryptsetup CLI only. Deliberately NOT the full
#                    `cryptsetup` package: that adds initramfs hooks and
#                    boot-time unlock machinery, and this data disk is never
#                    unlocked at boot (see /usr/local/bin/data-disk).
#   samba          - serves the platform data root to the Windows host. smbd
#                    stays up whether or not the disk is unlocked; the share
#                    stanza gates itself on the mount.
#   psmisc         - fuser, used by `data-disk lock` to report or kill the
#                    processes holding the mount. Not guaranteed present under
#                    the minimised install (see payload/extra_cfg/apt-minimal.conf).
cryptsetup-bin
samba
psmisc
